    "en": {
      "trackName": "Ski Escape: Snow Dash",
      "description": "Experience the thrill of a high-speed snow escape directly on your wrist. This endless runner game is custom-built for smartwatches, offering a seamless and immersive arcade experience without needing your phone.\nKey Features:\n\t•\tPrecision Control: Rotate the watch crown to control your character. This intuitive input allows for smooth gliding and perfectly timed jumps.\n\t•\tDodge the Seals: Stay alert and use your skills to escape from the persistent seals chasing you through the icy terrain.\n\t•\tPlay Anywhere: Fully standalone and offline. No internet connection or phone pairing required. Perfect for quick breaks, commutes, or flights.\n\t•\tEndless Challenge: The mountain never ends. Speed increases the further you go. Compete against yourself to set new high scores.\nStart your snowy adventure and see how far you can escape.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ski-escape-snow-dash/id6757392622?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "$0.99",
